<section class="py-20 text-center">
  <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-accent">404</p>
  <h1 class="mt-3 text-balance font-bold tracking-tight">No page for that model</h1>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-pretty text-base text-slate-700">
    Either the id is spelled differently, or we have not catalogued it yet. Both are worth
    reporting — the second is how the catalog grows.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 text-sm">
    <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 font-medium text-white hover:bg-slate-800">Browse all models</a>
    <a href="<%= calendarPath %>" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2 font-medium text-slate-700 hover:bg-warm-hover">Shutdown calendar</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/mnfst/modeldeprecations.dev/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2 font-medium text-slate-700 hover:bg-warm-hover">Request a model</a>
  </div>
</section>
